{{!
    @template local_edwiserpagebuilder/ai_badge_button

    AI-enhanced "Create custom block" card. Wraps the standard block_card
    partial with AI badge styling when AI is available.
    Falls back to plain block_card when AI is not available.

    Context variables required:
    * ai_available - Whether the core AI subsystem is available (Moodle 4.5+)
    * htmlblock - The htmlblock category data from block_handler (has blocks array)

    Example context (json):
    { "ai_available": true, "htmlblock": { "blocks": [{"title": "Create custom blocks"}] } }
}}
{{#ai_available}}
<div class="ai-block-creator-active">
    {{#htmlblock}}
        {{> local_edwiserpagebuilder/block_card }}
    {{/htmlblock}}
</div>
{{/ai_available}}
{{^ai_available}}
{{#htmlblock}}
    {{> local_edwiserpagebuilder/block_card }}
{{/htmlblock}}
{{/ai_available}}
